          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "63",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uzakhumbula, uyangeke, ungaphindi ukuvula umlomo wakho futhi ngenxa yehlazo lakho, nxa sengikuthethelela konke lokho okwenzileyo, kutsho iNkosi uNkulunkulu.",
          "type": "text",
